---
// Variant 2: Split editorial — tekst på cream venstre, billede højre
---

<section class="hero-v2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2" style="background: #fbf9f8;">
  <div class="hero-v2-text-wrap flex items-center">
    <div class="hero-v2-text px-8 md:px-16 py-24 md:py-0">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6" style="color: #6f4315; font-family: var(--font-label); letter-spacing: 0.3em;">
        Tækkemand siden 1972
      </span>
      <h1 class="hero-v2-h1 leading-[1.05] mb-8" style="font-family: var(--font-headline); color: #1b1c1c;">
        Stråtag der holder <span class="italic" style="color:#6f4315">i generationer</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-10 leading-relaxed text-lg" style="color: #51443a; font-family: var(--font-body); max-width: 520px;">
        Over 50 års erfaring bag hvert tag. Vi har stået bag Nordens største tækkeprojekt på 5.000 m² — og leverer dit projekt med samme kompromisløse kvalitet.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <a href="#kontakt" class="px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105"
          style="background: #6f4315; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-body);">
          Få et uforpligtende tilbud
        </a>
        <a href="tel:+4524248080" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-lg" style="color: #1b1c1c; font-family: var(--font-body);">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
          </svg>
          24 24 80 80
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-8" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(111,67,21,0.2);">
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-headline); color: #6f4315;">50+</div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1" style="color: #51443a; font-family: var(--font-label);">års erfaring</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-headline); color: #6f4315;">90</div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1" style="color: #51443a; font-family: var(--font-label);">dage levering</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-headline); color: #6f4315;">5000m²</div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1" style="color: #51443a; font-family: var(--font-label);">største projekt</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-v2-img-wrap relative">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/img/straatag1-hero.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="object-position: 50% center;"
        src="/img/straatag1-hero.jpg" alt="Stråtag af Tækkemand Carlsen"
        fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" width="1080" height="1080" />
    </picture>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-v2 { min-height: 100svh; }
  .hero-v2-h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 7vw, 3.25rem); }
  .hero-v2-img-wrap { min-height: 400px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero-v2 { min-height: 720px; max-height: 880px; }
    .hero-v2-text-wrap { padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
    .hero-v2-h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 4.5vw, 4.25rem); }
    .hero-v2-img-wrap { min-height: 720px; }
  }
</style>
</content>
</invoke>